{"id": "DfDFNQ5tDOO", "title": "Video by shawez_immo", "description": "€2.5 million in Burgundy. Same building, two completely different lives.\n⠀\nFrom the street, it’s just another stone façade in the heart of Beaune. You’d walk straight past it.\n⠀\nPush the door and there’s a private courtyard with a timber gallery on old stone columns. Go up one floor and the style changes completely — beams, light, parquet, and a kind of quiet you don’t get in a new build.\n⠀\nThis is the France everyone says they dream about and nobody ever checks the price of. So I filmed both floors for you.\n⠀\nGround floor or the one upstairs — which would you take? Tell me below, I read every comment.\n⠀\nFor the real details, comment VISIT and I’ll send them to you in a private message.\n⠀\nAnd send this to the person you’d be buying it with.\n⠀\nBeaune, Côte d’Or — just over two hours from Paris by train, in the middle of the Burgundy wine country.\n⠀\n#beaune #burgundy #frenchproperty #cotedor #frenchrealestate", "channel": "shawez_immo", "uploader_id": "39659804928", "uploader": "Shawez Ali | Consultant immobilier", "timestamp": 1793212616, "like_count": 7, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-3219027801633491a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 60.989, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOT32jxlju2i5He-HUe5IATAL9IzlEkyooKqznYt0T1N8BavlVJkZGNgqv6jyB5dJGzaeKF2dCrsioKD_v1MN_2megrBWa_CBm8AUg.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=q9ExSWvMISAQ7kNvwFn1kUs&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=qiDf1rshxeXMb176NA59kw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQYzkqTJ2yWZbD6kvLEAYXeIpEMq-QzjqYGMeOdaNPXVg&oe=6AE44891", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 60.989, "resolution": "audio only", "h